        <mxCell id="c3d" value="18 fun&#231;&#245;es. Existem porque a policy correta torna a opera&#231;&#227;o&#10;imposs&#237;vel pelo cliente:&#10;&#8226; criar_tribo &#8212; o insert exige role=member, ent&#227;o o criador&#10;&#160;&#160;n&#227;o conseguia entrar como leader&#10;&#8226; entrar_na_tribo_por_codigo &#8212; n&#227;o-membro n&#227;o enxerga a&#10;&#160;&#160;tribo privada, logo nunca a acha pelo invite_code&#10;&#8226; denuncias_da_minha_tribo &#183; resolver_denuncia&#10;&#8226; pode_ler_versao &#183; is_tribe_member &#183; is_tribe_shepherd" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#6D28D9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="856" y="518" width="400" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
